{"availability":"available","full":"mrestrepoj10/cantera","name":"cantera","description":"Construction UI. shadcn-native. Public mirror of the cantera registry: free sources, registry JSON, agent skill, and templates.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-06T02:44:53Z","updated":"2026-10-11T02:45:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://canteraui.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://canteraui.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:49.458Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:49.458Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:49.458Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:49.458Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Construction UI. shadcn-native. Components for AEC data — ACC-ready, source-agnostic. Install with the shadcn CLI, own the code.","cantera is a shadcn registry, not an npm package: npx shadcn@latest add copies the source into your project. Components are built on your project's shadcn primitives and inherit your theme, base, and style. They take plain typed props — data in, callbacks out — so they work with data from Autodesk Construction Cloud, Procore, or anywhere else. Provider-specific presets and adapters translate real APIs into those props.","This repository is the public mirror of the cantera registry: the free sources, the generated registry JSON, the agent skill, and the free templates, synced from the private workspace on every merge. It is read-only. Open issues here; pull requests are ported by hand."],"features":["Site and live demo: canteraui.vercel.app","Token layer companion: aec-auth","Zero-credential OAuth demos: emulate (@emulators/aps)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mrestrepoj10/cantera/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"af1349f2938c5152efd39865e4a761c0b7e7fe2900c74e3ad631991e6367168d","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:49.567Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:49.567Z","proje